<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V WEST INDIES SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V WEST INDIES SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the end of the</p>
<p>second day of the fourth cricket test between Australia and West</p>
<p>Indies at the Adelaide Oval on Sunday.</p>
<p>West Indies:</p>
<p>First innings - 130 in 47.5 overs (Michael Bevan four for</p>
<p>31, Shane Warne three for 42.)</p>
<p>Australia:</p>
<p>First innings (139 for two overnight)</p>
<p> Mark Taylor		 lbw Bishop		  11</p>
<p> Matthew Hayden	    st Murray b Hooper     125</p>
<p> Justin Langer	     c Murray b Cuffy	  19</p>
<p> Mark Waugh		  c Murray b Hooper	 82</p>
<p> Steve Waugh		 c Hooper b Chanderpaul  26</p>
<p> Greg Blewett		not out		     91</p>
<p> Michael Bevan	     not out		     47</p>
<p> Extras (b-2 lb-12 w-4 nb-15)			  33</p>
<p> Total (for five wickets, 130 overs)		434</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-35, 2-78, 3-242, 4-288, 5-288.</p>
<p>To bat: Ian Healey, Shane Warne, Andrew Bichel, Glenn</p>
<p>McGrath.</p>
<p>Bowling: Courtney Walsh 27-3-84-0 (nb-4), Ian Bishop</p>
<p>25-3-70-1 (nb-10, w-1), Cameron Cuffy 24-3-88-1 (nb-1, w-2)</p>
<p>Patterson Thompson 13-0-67-0 (w-1), Carl Hooper 30-6-86-2, Jimmy</p>
<p>Adams 8-0-23-0, Shivnarine Chanderpaul 3-1-2-1.</p>
